### 21.70.070 Submittal requirements.

At the presubmission conference, the site plan and landscaping plan may be conceptual in form. After presubmission, the application for design review shall contain the following items:

A. Plans. The license stamps of the architect and landscape architect shall be on each appropriate page.

1. Site Plan. A site plan is required containing the following information:

   a. Scale and north arrow;

   b. Address of site;

